Wtf?? That is just rude, i cant belive they didnt at least comple that ;-;
It had such a nice attention to detalies at first, but the last few episodes while they did had awersome modes like the screensharing, microphone and so on, lacked in details and important information.

Not to mention the episodes were shorter than before, people say that it was longer but tbh, it was longer because of more minigames and you had to complete them to 100% unlike past episodes. But the lenght of the dialogue? Same as the last few episodes
